(82, 'Franchise Link', 'franchise page,franchise info,franchise details,franchise FAQ,FRANCHISE PAGE,FRANCHISE INFO,FRANCHISE DETAILS,FRANCHISE FAQ', 'Franchise info: https://www.arakutribe.com/coffee_franchise.php'),
